version, so it is distributed under the same terms; see LICENSE.

Ported from kokoro (https://github.com/hexgrad/kokoro, Apache License 2.0, by
hexgrad), at brendanlong/kokoro commit 66c8ed5: kokoro/foreign.py, and
KPipeline.en_g2p_tokens and tokens_to_ps in kokoro/pipeline.py.

Ported from Kokoro-FastAPI (https://github.com/remsky/Kokoro-FastAPI, Apache
License 2.0), as forked at https://github.com/brendanlong/Kokoro-FastAPI, at
the commit reference/setup.sh pins: api/src/inference/g2p.py
(phonemize) and _word_spans in api/src/inference/kokoro_v1.py.

src/vocab.rs holds the vocabulary from Kokoro-82M's config.json
(https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M, Apache License 2.0).

src/tables.rs is generated from the Unicode data in the Python `regex` package
the reference uses (reference/gen_pipeline_tables.py), which is derived from the
Unicode Character Database; COPYING.UCD has the Unicode terms for that data.
